,"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"id":"name-nanqi047-yuyun","person_id":"b1c_66j_t4c","surname":"虞","ming":"雲","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0006","source_anchor":{"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003","mention_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0006","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"虞雲","person_id":"b1c_66j_t4c"},"quote":"子隆在荊州，好辭賦，數集僚友，朓以文才，尤被賞愛，流連晤對，不捨日夕。長史王秀之以朓年少相動，密以啓聞。世祖敕曰：「侍讀虞雲自宜恒應侍接。朓可還都。」朓道中爲詩寄西府曰：「常恐鷹隼擊，秋菊委嚴霜。寄言罻羅者，寥廓已高翔。」遷新安王中軍記室。朓牋辭子隆曰：「朓聞潢汙之水，思朝宗而每竭；駑蹇之乘，希沃若而中疲。何則？皐壤搖落，對之惆悵；岐路東西，或以嗚悒。況乃服義徒擁，歸志莫從，邈若墜雨，飄似秋蔕。朓實庸流，行能無算，屬天地休明，山川受納，褒採一介，搜揚小善，捨耒場圃，奉筆菟園。東亂三江，西浮七澤，契闊戎旃，從容讌語。長裾日曳，後乘載脂，榮立府廷，恩加顏色。沐髮晞陽，未測涯涘；撫臆論報，早誓肌骨。不悟滄溟未運，波臣自蕩；渤澥方春，旅翮先謝。清切蕃房，寂寥舊蓽。輕舟反泝，弔影獨留，白雲在天，龍門不見。去德滋永，思德滋深。唯待青江可望，候歸艎於春渚；朱邸方開，效蓬心於秋實。如其簪履或存，衽席無改，雖復身填溝壑，猶望妻子知歸。攬涕告辭，悲來橫集。」","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"note":"此段完整原姓名供構件，非由職稱或ID拆姓。","work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-current-rendered-xietiao"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003:m0006","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"虞雲","kind":"person","person_id":"b1c_66j_t4c","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered:p003","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-xietiao-rendered"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-nanqi047-xietiao-yuyun","person_id":"b1c_66j_t4c","surfaces":["虞